    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>You awaken in a strange, abandoned research station. Disoriented and alone, clutching a handful of mysterious crimson coins. But you're not truly alone... Something lurks in the shadows, watching your every move.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004130/extras/22399dcaf3e660e386b2601711f56ce9.poster.avif?t=1751298035\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004130/extras/22399dcaf3e660e386b2601711f56ce9.webm?t=1751298035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004130/extras/22399dcaf3e660e386b2601711f56ce9.mp4?t=1751298035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Secrets of TARASET Station</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something terrible has happened here... But what is this place? And how did you get here?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004130/extras/957fe88fc409a0056f3cdec7e3957c65.poster.avif?t=1751298035\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004130/extras/957fe88fc409a0056f3cdec7e3957c65.webm?t=1751298035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004130/extras/957fe88fc409a0056f3cdec7e3957c65.mp4?t=1751298035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An unsettling Shadow</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sinister entity dwells in the station's dark corridors, drawn to noise and light. Hide when necessary and try to escape this nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004130/extras/4f3b809e9af5811c638d9d308b979316.poster.avif?t=1751298035\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004130/extras/4f3b809e9af5811c638d9d308b979316.webm?t=1751298035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004130/extras/4f3b809e9af5811c638d9d308b979316.mp4?t=1751298035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you escape this dark place...\u00a0or become its prey?</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>You awaken in a strange, abandoned research station. Disoriented and alone, clutching a handful of mysterious crimson coins. But you're not truly alone... Something lurks in the shadows, watching your every move.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004130/extras/22399dcaf3e660e386b2601711f56ce9.poster.avif?t=1751298035\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004130/extras/22399dcaf3e660e386b2601711f56ce9.webm?t=1751298035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004130/extras/22399dcaf3e660e386b2601711f56ce9.mp4?t=1751298035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Secrets of TARASET Station</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something terrible has happened here... But what is this place? And how did you get here?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004130/extras/957fe88fc409a0056f3cdec7e3957c65.poster.avif?t=1751298035\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004130/extras/957fe88fc409a0056f3cdec7e3957c65.webm?t=1751298035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004130/extras/957fe88fc409a0056f3cdec7e3957c65.mp4?t=1751298035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An unsettling Shadow</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sinister entity dwells in the station's dark corridors, drawn to noise and light. Hide when necessary and try to escape this nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004130/extras/4f3b809e9af5811c638d9d308b979316.poster.avif?t=1751298035\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004130/extras/4f3b809e9af5811c638d9d308b979316.webm?t=1751298035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004130/extras/4f3b809e9af5811c638d9d308b979316.mp4?t=1751298035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you escape this dark place...\u00a0or become its prey?</strong></p>",
